The pair split across two configuration layers.

Codex walks from the project root to the working directory and loads every
`.codex/config.toml` it finds, so a root that stops the asking and a nested
file that permits writes leave neither control for a run below. The finding is
placed at the sandbox and names the file the other half came from.

>>> .codex/config.toml
approval_policy = "never"
>>> service/.codex/config.toml
sandbox_mode = "workspace-write"
